ers/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T20:38:08Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T21:06:18Z","body":"> Will this conflict with the syntax we have in VectorView to construct a single element VectorView from a pointer? I have found that constructor very helpful so far.\r\n> \r\n> https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/30bb49ec1ff3b3fc463074b8d28bc97d4db50b9f/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.h#L72-L75\r\n\r\nI've seen that code. I had a quick test, it seems it's fine:\r\n```c++\r\nint main() {\r\n    // Both work, using respective constructors\r\n    static const char str[] = \"Hello World!\";\r\n    function_taking_span(str);\r\n    function_taking_span(\"Hello World!\");\r\n    function_taking_span('a');\r\n}\r\n```\r\nThe `VectorView` constructor is taking a l-value reference, while the one proposed here is taking a C array.\r\nTaking in `char[]`, the `VectorView` one will probably try to create `Span<char*>`, but since `Span<char>` is required, the C char constructor will be selected instead.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711769048/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761476073","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103923#issuecomment-2761476073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103923","id":2761476073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6kmMfp","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-28T14:08:07Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T14:08:07Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2761476073/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]